 "section_summary": "This section comprises pages 10 through 66 of an extensive statistical directory and roster of educational institutions in Gifu Prefecture, Japan, continuing from the preceding section. It inventories prefectural special schools (for the blind and deaf-mute) and youth schools, municipal secondary and elementary schools as well as kindergartens, and village or town secondary schools (youth schools and girls' high schools) and elementary schools. For each institution, the roster tabulates the official name, address, date of founding, and enrollment and teaching staff statistics disaggregated by sex as of April 30, 1946, and November 30, 1946.",
