   "start_page": 138,
   "summary": "This section contains internal pages 10 through 66 of a comprehensive roster of educational institutions across Gifu Prefecture, continuing from earlier sections. It details prefectural special education schools and youth schools, municipal commercial, industrial, agricultural, middle, girls' high, youth, and elementary schools, as well as village and town youth and elementary schools. Each institutional listing records the location, founding date, and comparative male, female, and total counts for both student enrollment and teaching staff as of April 30, 1946, and November 30, 1946.",
